OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with the
OL,6,Fbest of any limited brighter spells
OL,7,Fappearing early and towards Inverness.
OL,8,FOccasional light rain, more persistent
OL,9,Fover western districts. South to
OL,10,Fsoutheast winds occasionally strong
OL,11,Fover western coasts and Isles.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPatchy rain turning heavy by
OL,14,Flate evening, then clearing to only a
OL,15,Ffew light showers overnight. Brisk
OL,16,Fsoutherly winds reaching gale force in
OL,17,Fwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
