OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA mix of scattered showers
OL,6,Fand brighter spells during the
OL,7,Fmorning. Outbreaks building for the
OL,8,Fafternoon, bringing the risk of
OL,9,Fthunderstorms in the west late
OL,10,Fafternoon. Brisk southwest winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FWednesday very windy with rain, which
OL,14,Fturns heavy at times. A mix of
OL,15,Fbrighter spells and scattered showers
OL,16,Ffor Thursday and Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
